      },
      {
        "t": 32.8,
        "text": "And eyes, and ears, and mouth, and nose!"
      },
      {
        "t": 37.8,
        "text": "Clap your hands and stamp your feet, stamp your feet!"
      },
      {
        "t": 42.6,
        "text": "Touch your hair and wiggle your fingers, too!"
      },
